new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b5efae1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/cappu_legacy/README.cappu
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# cappu protobuf ABI compatibility runtime
+
+This is the Android 8.1.0_r1 lite protobuf 3.0.0 runtime source (AOSP commit 7b77cf5e318d2a69ff2dc928225b0f25d7d222dd), kept isolated from the LineageOS 19.1 protobuf 3.9.1 runtime. The cappu Widevine blobs were built against protobuf 3.0.0, while the platform runtime is 3.9.1.
+
+The device-specific module exports only the protobuf symbols imported by the 32-bit and 64-bit cappu Widevine libraries. Keep `cappu_legacy32.exports.map` and `cappu_legacy64.exports.map` aligned with those blobs when updating the proprietary vendor files.
